      <fo:flow flow-name="xsl-region-body" start-indent="1in" end-indent="0pt">
         <fo:block id="service.dal">
            <fo:block font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
               <fo:block margin-left="0pt">
                  <fo:block font-size="24.8832pt" font-weight="bold">
                     <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                               xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                               keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                               space-before.optimum="0in"
                               space-before.minimum="0in"
                               space-before.maximum="0in"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               text-align="start"
                               start-indent="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                               font-size="28pt"
                               line-height="35pt"
                               font-weight="normal"
                               space-after="24pt">
                        <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                       provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                           <fo:list-item>
                              <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                 <fo:block>141</fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-label>
                              <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                 <fo:block>Device Abstraction Layer Specification</fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-body>
                           </fo:list-item>
                        </fo:list-block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                               xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookcItalic"
                               font-size="18pt"
                               line-height="25pt">
                        <fo:basic-link internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal">
                           <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                      font-family="inherit"
                                      letter-spacing="inherit"
                                      hyphenate="inherit">Version 1.0</fo:inline>
                        </fo:basic-link>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="service.dal-introduction">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Introduction</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>141.1</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Introduction</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The Internet-of-Things (IoT) has a major impact in the IT industry.
    It requires backend systems to receive information from sensors,
    actuators, and appliances in various vertical markets such as Smart Home,
    eHealth, industrial automation, logistics, and automotive telematics.
    Application developers have to face the still increasing amount of
    communication protocols which are the major hurdle for
    interoperability.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The Device Abstraction Layer specification provides a unified
    interface for application developers to interact with sensor, devices,
    etc. connected to a gateway. Application developers don't have to deal
    with protocol specific details which simplifies the development of their
    applications.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The remote device control provides an opportunity to save energy, to
    support better security, to save your time during daily tasks and more.
    The devices can play different roles in their networks as event reporters,
    controllers, etc. That dynamic behavior is well mappable to the dynamic
    OSGi service registry. When a new device is available in the network,
    there is a registration of a <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Device</fo:inline> service. It realizes
    basic set of management operations and provides a rich set of properties.
    The applications can track the device status, read descriptive information
    and follow the device relations. A set of functions can belong to a single
    device. They represent the device operations and related properties in an
    atomic way. The device functions can be found in the OSGi service
    registry. The applications are allowed to get directly the required
    functions if they don't need information about the device. For example,
    light device is registered as <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Device</fo:inline> service and there is
    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">Function</fo:inline> service to turn on and turn off the light. The
    application can operate with the light control service without access to
    the device service.</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d609e99">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>141.1.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Entities</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d609e101">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d609e102">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Device</fo:inline> - represents the device in the
          OSGi service registry. It's described with a set of service
          properties and provides basic management operations.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d609e106">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">Function</fo:inline> - atomic functional entity like
          switch or sensor. The function can belong to a device. The function
          provides a set of properties and operations.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d609e110">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">FunctionEvent</fo:inline> - asynchronous event. It's
          posted through <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">EventAdmin</fo:inline> service and notifies for
          <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">Function</fo:inline> property change.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d609e118">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">FunctionData</fo:inline> - data structure which
          carries <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">Function</fo:inline> property value with extra
          metadata.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d609e124">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:inline font-style="italic">PropertyMetadata</fo:inline> and
          <fo:inline font-style="italic">OperationMetadata</fo:inline> - contain metadata about the
          <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                         font-size="9pt"
                                         letter-spacing="0.08em">Function</fo:inline> properties and operations.</fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
               </fo:list-block>
               <fo:block start-indent="0pt">
                  <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                            space-before.optimum="1em"
                            space-before.maximum="2em"
                            space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                            space-after.optimum="1em"
                            space-after.maximum="2em"
                            keep-together.within-column="always"
                            id="d609e132">
                     <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                               xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                               space-before.optimum="5pt"
                               space-before.minimum="5pt"
                               space-before.maximum="5pt"
                               font-weight="normal"
                               font-size="9pt"
                               hyphenate="false"
                               space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                               space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                               space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                               start-indent="0pt"
                               font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                               font-style="italic"
                               keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                       provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                           <fo:list-item>
                              <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                 <fo:block>Figure 141.1</fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-label>
                              <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                 <fo:block>Device Abstraction Layer Overview</fo:block>
                              </fo:list-item-body>
                           </fo:list-item>
                        </fo:list-block>
                     </fo:block>
                     <fo:block id="d609e134" text-align="center">
                        <fo:external-graphic src="url(file:///home/stbischof/git/OSGI_MIGRATE/osgi_target/org.osgi.service.dal/spec/org.osgi.spec.service.dal/src/main/resources/spec/service.dal.overview.diagram.svg)"
                                             width="80%"
                                             height="auto"
                                             content-width="scale-to-fit"
                                             content-height="scale-to-fit"
                                             text-align="center"/>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="service.dal-device.access.category">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Device Category</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>141.2</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Device Category</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The device category defined in the scope of the Device Access
    service specification is called <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                          font-size="9pt"
                          letter-spacing="0.08em">DAL</fo:inline>. <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.DEVICE_CATEGORY">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">DEVICE_CATEGORY</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> constant contains the category name.</fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="service.dal-device.service">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Device Service</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>141.3</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Device Service</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">Device</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> interface is dedicated to a common access to the
    devices provided by different protocols. It can be mapped one to one with
    the physical device, but can be mapped only with a given functional part
    of the device. Another mapping can be a device realized with a set of
    <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">Device</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>
    services and different relations between them. <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">Device</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> service can
    represent pure software unit. For example, it can simulate the real device
    work. There are basic management operations for removal and property
    access. New protocol devices can be supported with the registration of new
    <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">Device</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>
    services.</fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">If the underlying protocol and the implementation allow, the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">Device</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> services
    must be registered again after the OSGi framework restarts. The service
    properties must be restored, the supported functions must be registered
    and <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">Device</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>
    relations must be visible to the applications.</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d609e163">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>141.3.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Device Service Properties</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The OSGi service registry has the advantage of being easily
      accessible. The services can be filtered and accessed with their
      properties. The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">Device</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> service has a rich set of such properties:
      <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d609e169">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e170">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.SERVICE_UID">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">SERVICE_UID</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> – Specifies the device unique identifier.
            It's a mandatory property. The value type is
            <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.String</fo:inline>. To simplify the unique identifier
            generation, the property value must follow the rule:</fo:block>
                              <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-after.optimum="1em"
                                        space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                        hyphenate="false"
                                        wrap-option="no-wrap"
                                        white-space-collapse="false"
                                        white-space-treatment="preserve"
                                        linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-size="9pt"
                                        letter-spacing="-.0em"
                                        space-before="5pt"
                                        space-after="3pt"
                                        space-after.conditionality="retain"
                                        start-indent="inherit"
                                        line-height="11pt"
                                        id="d609e176">UID ::= driver-name ':' device-id</fo:block>
                              <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                             provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                             id="d609e177">
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e178">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>UID – device unique identifier</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e180">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>driver-name – the value of the
                <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">Device.SERVICE_DRIVER</fo:inline> service property</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e185">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>device-id – device unique identifier in the scope of the
                driver</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e187">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.SERVICE_REFERENCE_UIDS">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">SERVICE_REFERENCE_UIDS</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> – Specifies the reference device unique
            identifiers. It's an optional property. The value type is
            <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.String[]</fo:inline>. It can be used to represent
            different relationships between the devices. For example, The
            EnOcean controller can have a reference to the USB dongle.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e193">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.SERVICE_DRIVER">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">SERVICE_DRIVER</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> – Specifies the device driver name. For
            example, EnOcean, Z-Wave, Bluetooth, etc. It's a mandatory
            property. The value type is <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.String</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e199">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.SERVICE_NAME">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">SERVICE_NAME</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> – Specifies the device name. It's an
            optional property. The value type is
            <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.String</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e205">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.SERVICE_STATUS">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">SERVICE_STATUS</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> – Specifies the current device status.
            It's a mandatory property. The value type
            <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.Integer</fo:inline>. The possible values are:</fo:block>
                              <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                             provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                             id="d609e211">
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e212">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_REMOVED">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_REMOVED</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> – Indicates that the device has been
                removed from the network. That status must be set as the last
                device status and after that the device service can be
                unregistered from the service registry. The status is
                available for stale device services too. All transitions to
                this status are described in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="service.dal-status.transitions.removed">
                                                <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                                           font-family="inherit"
                                                           letter-spacing="inherit"
                                                           hyphenate="inherit">
                                                   <fo:inline font-style="italic">Removed</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dal-status.transitions.removed"/>
                                                </fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e218">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_OFFLINE">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> – Indicates that the device is
                currently not available for operations. The end device is
                available in the network and can become online later. The
                controller is unplugged or there is no connection. All
                transitions to and from this status are described in detail in
                <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="service.dal-status.transitions.offline">
                                                <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                                           font-family="inherit"
                                                           letter-spacing="inherit"
                                                           hyphenate="inherit">
                                                   <fo:inline font-style="italic">Offline</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dal-status.transitions.offline"/>
                                                </fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e224">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_ONLINE">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> – Indicates that the device is
                currently available for operations. The recent communication
                with the device has been passed through. All transitions to
                and from this status are described in detail in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="service.dal-status.transitions.online">
                                                <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                                           font-family="inherit"
                                                           letter-spacing="inherit"
                                                           hyphenate="inherit">
                                                   <fo:inline font-style="italic">Online</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dal-status.transitions.online"/>
                                                </fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e230">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_PROCESSING">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> – Indicates that the device is
                currently busy with an operation. All transitions to and from
                this status are described in detail in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="service.dal-status.transitions.processing">
                                                <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                                           font-family="inherit"
                                                           letter-spacing="inherit"
                                                           hyphenate="inherit">
                                                   <fo:inline font-style="italic">Processing</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dal-status.transitions.processing"/>
                                                </fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e236">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> – Indicates that the device is
                currently not initialized. Some protocols don't provide device
                information right after the device is connected. The device
                can be initialized later when it's awakened. All transitions
                to and from this status are described in detail in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="service.dal-status.transitions.not.initialized">
                                                <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                                           font-family="inherit"
                                                           letter-spacing="inherit"
                                                           hyphenate="inherit">
                                                   <fo:inline font-style="italic">Not Initialized</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dal-status.transitions.not.initialized"/>
                                                </fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e242">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> – Indicates that the device is
                currently not configured. The device can require additional
                actions to become completely connected to the network. All
                transitions to and from this status are described in detail in
                <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="service.dal-status.transitions.not.configured">
                                                <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                                           font-family="inherit"
                                                           letter-spacing="inherit"
                                                           hyphenate="inherit">
                                                   <fo:inline font-style="italic">Not Configured</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dal-status.transitions.not.configured"/>
                                                </fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e248">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.SERVICE_STATUS_DETAIL">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">SERVICE_STATUS_DETAIL</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> – Provides the reason for the current
            device status. It's an optional property. The property value
            cannot be externally set or modified. The value type is
            <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.Integer</fo:inline>. There are two value categories.
            Positive values indicate the reason for the current status like
            <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_DETAIL_CONNECTING">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">STATUS_DETAIL_CONNECTING</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>. Negative values indicate errors related
            to the current device status like <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_DETAIL_BROKEN">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">STATUS_DETAIL_BROKEN</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>. The list with defined status details
            is:</fo:block>
                              <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                             provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                             id="d609e258">
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e259">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_DETAIL_CONNECTING">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_DETAIL_CONNECTING</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> – The device is currently connecting
                to the network. The status detail indicates the reason with a
                positive value <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">1</fo:inline>. The device status must be <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_PROCESSING">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e267">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_DETAIL_INITIALIZING">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_DETAIL_INITIALIZING</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> – The device is currently in process
                of initialization. The status detail indicates the reason with
                a positive value <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">2</fo:inline>. The network controller
                initializing means that information about the network is
                currently read. The device status must be <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_PROCESSING">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e275">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_DETAIL_REMOVING">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_DETAIL_REMOVING</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> – The device is leaving the network.
                The status detail indicates the reason with positive value
                <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">3</fo:inline>. The device status must be <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_PROCESSING">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e283">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_DETAIL_FIRMWARE_UPDATING">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_DETAIL_FIRMWARE_UPDATING</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> – The device firmware is updating. The
                status detail indicates the reason with positive value
                <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">4</fo:inline>. The device status must be <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_PROCESSING">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e291">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_DETAIL_CONFIGURATION_UNAPPLIED">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_DETAIL_CONFIGURATION_UNAPPLIED</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> – The device configuration is not
                applied. The status detail indicates an error with a negative
                value <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">-1</fo:inline>. The device status must be <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e299">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_DETAIL_BROKEN">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_DETAIL_BROKEN</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> – The device is broken. The status
                detail indicates an error with a negative value
                <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">-2</fo:inline>. The device status must be <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_OFFLINE">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e307">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_DETAIL_COMMUNICATION_ERROR">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_DETAIL_COMMUNICATION_ERROR</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> – The device communication is
                problematic. The status detail indicates an error with a
                negative value <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">-3</fo:inline>. The device status must be
                <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_ONLINE">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> or <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e317">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_DETAIL_DATA_INSUFFICIENT">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_DETAIL_DATA_INSUFFICIENT</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> – The device doesn't provide enough
                information and cannot be determined. The status detail
                indicates an error with a negative value <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">-4</fo:inline>. The
                device status must be <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e325">
