                                             </fo:basic-link> – The device is in duty cycle. The
                status detail indicates an error with a negative value
                <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">-7</fo:inline>. The device status must be <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_OFFLINE">
