               <fo:block id="service.dal-status.transitions.removed">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>141.3.4.1</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>Removed</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The device can go to <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_REMOVED">
                        <fo:inline color="blue"
                                   font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                   letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                   hyphenate="false">STATUS_REMOVED</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link> from any other status. Once reached, the
        device status cannot be updated any more. The device has been removed
        from the network and the device service is unregistered from the OSGi
        service registry. If there are stale references to the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device">
                        <fo:inline color="blue"
                                   font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                   letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                   hyphenate="false">Device</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link> service,
        their status will be set to <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_REMOVED">
                        <fo:inline color="blue"
                                   font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                   letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                   hyphenate="false">STATUS_REMOVED</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The common way for a given device to be removed is <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.remove--">
                        <fo:inline color="blue"
                                   font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                   letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                   hyphenate="false">remove()</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>
        method. When the method returns, the device status will be <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_REMOVED">
                        <fo:inline color="blue"
                                   font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                   letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                   hyphenate="false">STATUS_REMOVED</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>. It requires a synchronous execution of the
        operation.</fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="service.dal-status.transitions.offline">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>141.3.4.2</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>Offline</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_OFFLINE">
                        <fo:inline color="blue"
                                   font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                   letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                   hyphenate="false">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link> indicates that the device is currently not
        available for operations. That status can be set, because of different
        reasons. The network controller has been unplugged, the connection to
        the device has been lost, etc. The device can move to this status from
        any other status with the exception of <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_REMOVED">
                        <fo:inline color="blue"
                                   font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                   letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                   hyphenate="false">STATUS_REMOVED</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>. Transitions to and from this status are:
        <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                    space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                    space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                    space-after.optimum="1em"
                                    space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                    space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                    provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                    id="d609e649">
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e650">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_REMOVED</fo:inline> – The device has been removed. The
              status can be set as a result of <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                   xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                   internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.remove--">
                                       <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                  font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                  letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                  hyphenate="false">remove()</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:basic-link> method call.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e659">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> – Device data is
              processing.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e666">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> – The device has a pending
              configuration.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e673">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> – Device data has been read and the
              device is currently available for operations.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e680">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> – That transition is not
              possible, because the status have to go through
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline>. If the processing is
              unsuccessful, <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> will be
              set.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e691">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_REMOVED</fo:inline> – That transition is not possible.
              If the device has been removed, the service will be unregistered
              from the service registry.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e698">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> – The device is not accessible
              any more while device data is processing.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e705">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> – The device with pending
              configuration is not accessible any more.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e712">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> – The online device is not accessible
              any more.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e719">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> – The not initialized device
              is not accessible any more.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block> The possible transitions are summarized on <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.dal-figure.device.status.transitions.offline">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">Figure 141.4</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>.
        <fo:block start-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1em"
                                  space-before.maximum="2em"
                                  space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                                  space-after.optimum="1em"
                                  space-after.maximum="2em"
                                  keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  id="service.dal-figure.device.status.transitions.offline">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                     space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                     space-before.maximum="5pt"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     font-size="9pt"
                                     hyphenate="false"
                                     space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                                     space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                                     space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-style="italic"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>Figure 141.4</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Transitions to and from STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                           <fo:block id="d609e731" text-align="center">
                              <fo:external-graphic src="url(file:///home/stbischof/git/OSGI_MIGRATE/osgi_target/org.osgi.service.dal/spec/org.osgi.spec.service.dal/src/main/resources/spec/service.dal.status.transitions.offline.svg)"
                                                   width="70%"
                                                   height="auto"
                                                   content-width="scale-to-fit"
                                                   content-height="scale-to-fit"
                                                   text-align="center"/>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="service.dal-status.transitions.online">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>141.3.4.3</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>Online</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_ONLINE">
                        <fo:inline color="blue"
                                   font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                   letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                   hyphenate="false">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link> indicates that the device is currently
        available for operations. The online devices are initialized and ready
        for use. Transitions to and from this status are: <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                    space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                    space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                    space-after.optimum="1em"
                                    space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                    space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                    provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                    id="d609e740">
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e741">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_REMOVED</fo:inline> – The device has been removed. The
              status can be set as a result of <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                   xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                   internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.remove--">
                                       <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                  font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                  letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                  hyphenate="false">remove()</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:basic-link> method call.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e750">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> – The device data is
              processing.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e757">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> – The device has a pending
              configuration.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e764">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> – The online device is not
              accessible any more.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e771">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> – That transition is not
              possible. Online devices are initialized.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e778">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_REMOVED</fo:inline> – That transition is not possible.
              If the device has been removed, the service will be unregistered
              from the service registry.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e785">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> – Initial device data has been
              read. The device is available for operations.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e792">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> – The device pending
              configuration is satisfied.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e799">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> – The device is accessible for
              operations.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e806">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> – That transition is not
              possible. The device data has to be processed and then the
              device can become online. Intermediate status
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> will be used.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block> The possible transitions are summarized on <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.dal-figure.device.status.transitions.online">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">Figure 141.5</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>.
        <fo:block start-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1em"
                                  space-before.maximum="2em"
                                  space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                                  space-after.optimum="1em"
                                  space-after.maximum="2em"
                                  keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  id="service.dal-figure.device.status.transitions.online">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                     space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                     space-before.maximum="5pt"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     font-size="9pt"
                                     hyphenate="false"
                                     space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                                     space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                                     space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-style="italic"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>Figure 141.5</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Transitions to and from STATUS_ONLINE</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                           <fo:block id="d609e820" text-align="center">
                              <fo:external-graphic src="url(file:///home/stbischof/git/OSGI_MIGRATE/osgi_target/org.osgi.service.dal/spec/org.osgi.spec.service.dal/src/main/resources/spec/service.dal.status.transitions.online.svg)"
                                                   width="90%"
                                                   height="auto"
                                                   content-width="scale-to-fit"
                                                   content-height="scale-to-fit"
                                                   text-align="center"/>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="service.dal-status.transitions.processing">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>141.3.4.4</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>Processing</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The status indicates that the device is currently busy with an
        operation. It can be time consuming operation and can result to any
        other status. The operation processing can be reached by any other
        status except <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_REMOVED">
                        <fo:inline color="blue"
                                   font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                   letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                   hyphenate="false">STATUS_REMOVED</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>. For example, offline device requires some
        data processing to become online. It will apply this status sequence:
        <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                font-size="9pt"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline>, <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                font-size="9pt"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> and
        <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                font-size="9pt"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline>. Transitions to and from this status are:
        <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                    space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                    space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                    space-after.optimum="1em"
                                    space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                    space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                    provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                    id="d609e835">
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e836">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_REMOVED</fo:inline> – The device has been removed. The
              status can be set as a result of <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                   xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                   internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.remove--">
                                       <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                  font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                  letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                  hyphenate="false">remove()</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:basic-link> method call.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e845">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> – Initial device data has been read.
              The device is available for operations.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e852">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> – The device has a pending
              configuration.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e859">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> – The device is not accessible any
              more.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e866">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> – The device initial data is
              partially read.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e873">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_REMOVED</fo:inline> – That transition is not possible.
              If the device has been removed, the service will be unregistered
              from the service registry.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e880">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> – The device is busy with an
              operation.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e887">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> – The device pending
              configuration is satisfied and the device is busy with an
              operation.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e894">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> – The device is busy with an
              operation.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e901">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> – The device initial data is
              processing.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block> The possible transitions are summarized on <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.dal-figure.device.status.transitions.processing">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">Figure 141.6</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>.
        <fo:block start-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1em"
                                  space-before.maximum="2em"
                                  space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                                  space-after.optimum="1em"
                                  space-after.maximum="2em"
                                  keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  id="service.dal-figure.device.status.transitions.processing">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                     space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                     space-before.maximum="5pt"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     font-size="9pt"
                                     hyphenate="false"
                                     space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                                     space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                                     space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-style="italic"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>Figure 141.6</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Transitions to and from STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                           <fo:block id="d609e914" text-align="center">
                              <fo:external-graphic src="url(file:///home/stbischof/git/OSGI_MIGRATE/osgi_target/org.osgi.service.dal/spec/org.osgi.spec.service.dal/src/main/resources/spec/service.dal.status.transitions.processing.svg)"
                                                   width="90%"
                                                   height="auto"
                                                   content-width="scale-to-fit"
                                                   content-height="scale-to-fit"
                                                   text-align="center"/>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="service.dal-status.transitions.not.initialized">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>141.3.4.5</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>Not Initialized</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">The status indicates that the device is currently not
        initialized. Some protocols don't provide device information right
        after the device is connected. The device can be initialized later
        when it's awakened. The not initialized device requires some data
        processing to become online. <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_PROCESSING">
                        <fo:inline color="blue"
                                   font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                   letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                   hyphenate="false">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link> is used as an intermediate status. Transitions
        to and from this status are: <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                    space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                    space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                    space-after.optimum="1em"
                                    space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                    space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                    provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                    id="d609e923">
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e924">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_REMOVED</fo:inline> – The device has been removed. The
              status can be set as a result of <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                   xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                   internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.remove--">
                                       <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                  font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                  letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                  hyphenate="false">remove()</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:basic-link> method call.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e933">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> – The device data is
              processing.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e940">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> – That transition is not
              possible. Device requires some data processing.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e947">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> – The device is not accessible any
              more.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e954">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> – That transition is not possible.
              Device requires some data processing to become online.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e961">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_REMOVED</fo:inline> – That transition is not possible.
              If the device has been removed, the service will be unregistered
              from the service registry.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e968">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> – Device data is partially
              read.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e975">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> – That transition is not
              possible. When device pending configuration is satisfied, the
              device requires additional data processing.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e982">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> – That transition is not possible.
              Device requires some data processing and then can become not
              initialized.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e989">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> – That transition is not possible.
              The online device is initialized.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block> The possible transitions are summarized on <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.dal-figure.device.status.transitions.not.initialized">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">Figure 141.7</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>.
        <fo:block start-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1em"
                                  space-before.maximum="2em"
                                  space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                                  space-after.optimum="1em"
                                  space-after.maximum="2em"
                                  keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  id="service.dal-figure.device.status.transitions.not.initialized">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                     space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                     space-before.maximum="5pt"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     font-size="9pt"
                                     hyphenate="false"
                                     space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                                     space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                                     space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-style="italic"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>Figure 141.7</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Transitions to and from STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                           <fo:block id="d609e1001" text-align="center">
                              <fo:external-graphic src="url(file:///home/stbischof/git/OSGI_MIGRATE/osgi_target/org.osgi.service.dal/spec/org.osgi.spec.service.dal/src/main/resources/spec/service.dal.status.transitions.not.initialized.svg)"
                                                   width="70%"
                                                   height="auto"
                                                   content-width="scale-to-fit"
                                                   content-height="scale-to-fit"
                                                   text-align="center"/>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="service.dal-status.transitions.not.configured">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                           <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                        xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                        font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-weight="normal"
                                        keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                        space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        start-indent="0pt"
                                        hyphenate="false">
                                 <fo:block font-size="9pt"
                                           line-height="11pt"
                                           space-before="5pt"
                                           space-after="5pt">
                                    <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                   provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                       <fo:list-item>
                                          <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                             <fo:block>141.3.4.6</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-label>
                                          <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                             <fo:block>Not Configured</fo:block>
                                          </fo:list-item-body>
                                       </fo:list-item>
                                    </fo:list-block>
                                 </fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">Indicates that the device is currently not configured. The
        device can require additional actions to become completely connected
        to the network. For example, a given device button has to be pushed.
        That status doesn't have transitions with <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED">
                        <fo:inline color="blue"
                                   font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                   letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                   hyphenate="false">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>, because some data processing is required.
        Transitions to and from this status are: <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                    space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                    space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                    space-after.optimum="1em"
                                    space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                    space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                    provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                    provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                    id="d609e1010">
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e1011">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_REMOVED</fo:inline> – The device has been removed. The
              status can be set as a result of <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                   xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                   internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.remove--">
                                       <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                  font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                  letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                  hyphenate="false">remove()</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:basic-link> method call.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e1020">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> – The device pending
              configuration is satisfied and some additional data processing
              is required.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e1027">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> – The device pending configuration is
              satisfied.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e1034">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> – The device is not accessible any
              more.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e1041">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>From <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> to
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> – That transition is not
              possible. When device pending configuration is satisfied, the
              device requires additional data processing.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e1048">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_REMOVED</fo:inline> – That transition is not possible.
              If the device has been removed, the service will be unregistered
              from the service registry.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e1055">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_PROCESSING</fo:inline> – Initial device data has been
              read but there is a pending configuration.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e1062">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_ONLINE</fo:inline> – The device has a pending
              configuration.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e1069">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_OFFLINE</fo:inline> – The device is going to be online,
              but has a pending configuration.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                        <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                      space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                      id="d609e1076">
                           <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                              <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-label>
                           <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:block>To <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:inline> from
              <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">STATUS_NOT_INITIALIZED</fo:inline> – That transition is not
              possible. Device requires some data processing.</fo:block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:list-item-body>
                        </fo:list-item>
                     </fo:list-block> The possible transitions are summarized on <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                    xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                    internal-destination="service.dal-figure.device.status.transitions.not.configured">
                        <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                   font-family="inherit"
                                   letter-spacing="inherit"
                                   hyphenate="inherit">Figure 141.8</fo:inline>
                     </fo:basic-link>.
        <fo:block start-indent="0pt">
                        <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.5em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1em"
                                  space-before.maximum="2em"
                                  space-after.minimum="0.5em"
                                  space-after.optimum="1em"
                                  space-after.maximum="2em"
                                  keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  id="service.dal-figure.device.status.transitions.not.configured">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                     space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                     space-before.maximum="5pt"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     font-size="9pt"
                                     hyphenate="false"
                                     space-after.minimum="0.4em"
                                     space-after.optimum="0.6em"
                                     space-after.maximum="0.8em"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     font-family="Proforma-Book,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-style="italic"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>Figure 141.8</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Transitions to and from STATUS_NOT_CONFIGURED</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                           <fo:block id="d609e1088" text-align="center">
                              <fo:external-graphic src="url(file:///home/stbischof/git/OSGI_MIGRATE/osgi_target/org.osgi.service.dal/spec/org.osgi.spec.service.dal/src/main/resources/spec/service.dal.status.transitions.not.configured.svg)"
                                                   width="100%"
                                                   height="auto"
                                                   content-width="scale-to-fit"
                                                   content-height="scale-to-fit"
                                                   text-align="center"/>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="service.dal-function">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Function Service</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>141.4</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Function Service</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">The user applications have full control over the device with the
    <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">Function</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link>
    services. Synchronous or asynchronous operations can trigger different
    actions. For example, turn on or off the light, can change the room
    temperature, send an user notification, etc. The action result can be
    reported immediately or later in case of concurrent execution. As a
    result, a <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                              xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                              internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function">
                  <fo:inline color="blue"
                             font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em"
                             hyphenate="false">Function</fo:inline>
               </fo:basic-link> property can be updated. The property is the
    device value container. It can provide, sensor information, meter data,
    the switch current position, etc. Different property access types allow
    the applications to read, write or receive events.</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d609e1099">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>141.4.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Function Service Properties</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The OSGi service registry has the advantage of being easily
      accessible. The services can be filtered and accessed with their
      properties. The function service has a rich set of such properties:
      <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d609e1103">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1104">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function.SERVICE_UID">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">SERVICE_UID</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> – mandatory service property. The property
            value is the function unique identifier. The value type is
            <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.String</fo:inline>. To simplify the unique identifier
            generation, the property value must follow the rule:</fo:block>
                              <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-before.optimum="1em"
                                        space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                        space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                        space-after.optimum="1em"
                                        space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                        hyphenate="false"
                                        wrap-option="no-wrap"
                                        white-space-collapse="false"
                                        white-space-treatment="preserve"
                                        linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                                        text-align="start"
                                        font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                        font-size="9pt"
                                        letter-spacing="-.0em"
                                        space-before="5pt"
                                        space-after="3pt"
                                        space-after.conditionality="retain"
                                        start-indent="inherit"
                                        line-height="11pt"
                                        id="d609e1110">function UID ::= device-id ':' function-id</fo:block>
                              <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                             provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                             id="d609e1111">
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e1112">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>function UID – function unique identifier</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e1114">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>device-id – the value of the Device.SERVICE_UID Device
                service property</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e1116">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>function-id – function identifier in the scope of the
                device</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                              <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                        space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                        space-before.maximum="5pt">If the function is not bound to a device, the function
            unique identifier can be device independent.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1119">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function.SERVICE_TYPE">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">SERVICE_TYPE</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> – optional service property. The service
            property value contains the function type. For example, the sensor
            function can have different types like temperature, pressure, etc.
            The value type is <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.String</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                              <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                        space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                        space-before.maximum="5pt">Organizations that want to use function types that do not
            clash with OSGi Working Group defined types should prefix their types
            in own namespace.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1126">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function.SERVICE_VERSION">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">SERVICE_VERSION</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> – optional service property. The service
            property value contains the function version. That version can
            point to specific implementation version and vary in the different
            vendor implementations. The value type is
            <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.String</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1132">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function.SERVICE_DEVICE_UID">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">SERVICE_DEVICE_UID</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> – optional service property. The property
            value is the device identifier. The function belongs to this
            device. The value type is <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.String</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1138">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function.SERVICE_REFERENCE_UIDS">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">SERVICE_REFERENCE_UIDS</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> – optional service property. The service
            property value contains the reference function unique identifiers.
            The value type is <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.String[]</fo:inline>. It can be used
            to represent different relationships between the functions.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1144">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function.SERVICE_DESCRIPTION">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">SERVICE_DESCRIPTION</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> – optional service property. The property
            value is the function description. The value type is
            <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.String</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1150">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function.SERVICE_OPERATION_NAMES">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">SERVICE_OPERATION_NAMES</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> – optional service property. The property
            is missing when there are no function operations and property must
            be set when there are function operations. The property value is
            the function operation names. The value type is
            <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.String[]</fo:inline>. It's not possible to exist two or
            more function operations with the same name i.e. the operation
            overloading is not allowed.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1156">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function.SERVICE_PROPERTY_NAMES">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">SERVICE_PROPERTY_NAMES</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> – optional service property. The property
            is missing when there are no function properties and property must
            be set when there are function properties. The property value is
            the function property names. The value type is
            <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.String[]</fo:inline>. It's not possible to exist two or
            more function properties with the same name.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="service.dal-function.registration">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>141.4.2</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Function Registration</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">On start up, the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Function</fo:inline> services are registered
      before the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">Device</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> service. It's possible that <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function.SERVICE_DEVICE_UID">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">SERVICE_DEVICE_UID</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> points to missing service at the moment of the
      registration. The reverse order is used when the services are
      unregistered. <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">Device</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> service is unregistered before the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">Function</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>
      services. The device registration procedure is available in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="service.dal-device.registration">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">
                        <fo:inline font-style="italic">Device Registration</fo:inline> on page <fo:page-number-citation ref-id="service.dal-device.registration"/>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">Function</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> service should be registered only under the
      function class hierarchy. Other classes can be used if there are no
      ambiguous representations. For example, an ambiguous representation can
      be a function registered under two independent function classes like
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">BinarySwitch</fo:inline> and <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Meter</fo:inline>. In this example, both
      functions support the same property “state” with different meaning.
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">getPropertyMetadata(String propertyName)</fo:inline> method cannot
      determinate which property is requested. It can be
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">BinarySwitch</fo:inline> “state” or <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Meter</fo:inline> “state”.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">To simplify the generic function discovery, the
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Function</fo:inline> interface must be used for the service
      registration. In this way, the generic applications can easily find all
      services, which are functions in the service registry. Because of this
      rule, this registration is not allowed: <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                            space-before.optimum="1em"
                            space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                            space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                            space-after.optimum="1em"
                            space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            wrap-option="no-wrap"
                            white-space-collapse="false"
                            white-space-treatment="preserve"
                            linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                            text-align="start"
                            font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            letter-spacing="-.0em"
                            space-before="5pt"
                            space-after="3pt"
                            space-after.conditionality="retain"
                            start-indent="inherit"
                            line-height="11pt"
                            id="d609e1198">context.registerService(MeterV1.class.getName(), this, regProps);</fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">If the implementation would like to mark that there is a function,
      but no specific function interface exists, the registration can be:
      <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                            space-before.optimum="1em"
                            space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                            space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                            space-after.optimum="1em"
                            space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            wrap-option="no-wrap"
                            white-space-collapse="false"
                            white-space-treatment="preserve"
                            linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                            text-align="start"
                            font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            letter-spacing="-.0em"
                            space-before="5pt"
                            space-after="3pt"
                            space-after.conditionality="retain"
                            start-indent="inherit"
                            line-height="11pt"
                            id="d609e1201">context.registerService(Function.class.getName(), this, regProps);</fo:block>
      Note that such functions usually don't have operations and
      properties.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d609e1203">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>141.4.3</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Function Interface</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">Function</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> is built by a set of properties and operations.
      The function can have unique identifier, type, version, description,
      link to the <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">Device</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> service and information about the referenced
      functions. <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">Function</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> interface must be the base interface for all
      functions. If the device provider defines custom functions, all of them
      must extend <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">Function</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> interface. It provides a common access to the
      operations and properties metadata.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">There are some general type rules, which unify the access to the
      function data. They make easier the transfer over different protocols.
      All properties and operation arguments must use one of: <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d609e1216">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1217">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Java primitive type or corresponding reference type.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1219">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Numerical type i.e. the type which extends
            <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.Number</fo:inline>. The numerical type must follow
            these conventions:</fo:block>
                              <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                             provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                             id="d609e1224">
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e1225">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>The type must provide a public static method called
                <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">valueOf</fo:inline> that returns an instance of the given
                type and takes a single <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline> argument or a
                public constructor which takes a single <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline>
                argument.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                              <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                        space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                        space-before.maximum="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d609e1235">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d609e1236">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>The <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           font-size="9pt"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em">String</fo:inline> argument from the previous
                  bullet can be provided by <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           font-size="9pt"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em">toString()</fo:inline> method of
                  the instance.</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1243">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.String</fo:inline>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1246">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Java Bean, but its properties must use those rules. Java
            Bean is defined in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="service.dal-ref.bean.spec">
                                    <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                               font-family="inherit"
                                               letter-spacing="inherit"
                                               hyphenate="inherit">[1] <fo:inline font-style="italic">JavaBeans Spec</fo:inline>
                                    </fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1251">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.util.Map</fo:inline> instance. The map keys can be
            <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.String</fo:inline>. The values of a single type follow
            these rules.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1257">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Array of defined types.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">In order to provide common behavior, all functions must follow a
      set of common rules related to the implementation of their setters,
      getters, operations and events: <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d609e1261">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1262">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>The setter method must be executed synchronously. If the
            underlying protocol can return response to the setter call, it
            must be awaited. It simplifies the property value modification and
            doesn't require asynchronous callback.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1264">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>The operation method must be executed synchronously. If the
            underlying protocol can return an operation confirmation or
            response, it must be awaited. It simplifies the operation
            execution and doesn't require asynchronous callback.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1266">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>The getter must return the last know cached property value.
            The device implementation is responsible to keep that value up to
            date. It'll speed up the applications when the function property
            values are collected. The same cached value can be shared between
            a few requests instead of a few calls to the real device.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1268">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>The function operations, getters and setters must not
            override <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.Object</fo:inline> and this interface methods.
            For example:</fo:block>
                              <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                             provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                             id="d609e1273">
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e1274">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">hashCode()</fo:inline> – it's
                <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.Object</fo:inline> method and invalid function
                operation;</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e1280">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">wait()</fo:inline> – it's <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.Object</fo:inline>
                method and invalid function operation;</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e1286">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">getClass()</fo:inline> – it's
                <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.Object</fo:inline> method and invalid function
                getter;</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e1292">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">getPropertyMetadata(String propertyName)</fo:inline> –
                it's <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">org.osgi.service.dal.Function</fo:inline> method and
                invalid function getter.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d609e1298">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>141.4.4</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Function Operations</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">Function</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> operations are the main callable units. They can
      perform a specific task on the device like turn on or turn off. They can
      be used by the applications to control the device. Operation names are
      available as a value of the service property <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function.SERVICE_OPERATION_NAMES">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">SERVICE_OPERATION_NAMES</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>. The operations are identified by their names.
      It's not possible to exist two operations with the same name i.e.
      overloaded operations are not allowed. They cannot override the property
      accessor methods. The operations are regular java methods. That implies
      that they have zero or more arguments and zero or one return value. The
      operation arguments and return value must follow the general type
      rules.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The operations can be optionally described with metadata. Metadata
      is accessible with <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function.getOperationMetadata-String-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">getOperationMetadata(String)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method. The result provides metadata about the
      operation, operation arguments and result value. Operation arguments and
      result value are using the same metadata as the function properties. The
      full details are defined in the next section.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="service.dal-function.properties">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>141.4.5</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Function Properties</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">Function</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> properties are class fields. Their values can be
      read with getter methods and can be set with setter methods. The
      property names are available as a value of the service property <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function.SERVICE_PROPERTY_NAMES">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">SERVICE_PROPERTY_NAMES</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>. The properties are identified by their names.
      It's not possible to exist two properties with the same name.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The function properties must be integrated according to these
      rules: <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d609e1318">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1319">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Getter methods must be available for all properties with
            <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.PropertyMetadata.ACCESS_READABLE">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">ACCESS_READABLE</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> access.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1324">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Getter method must return a subclass of <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.FunctionData">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">FunctionData</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1329">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Setter methods must be available for all properties with
            <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.PropertyMetadata.ACCESS_WRITABLE">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">ACCESS_WRITABLE</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> access.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1334">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Setter methods can be any combination of: <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d609e1337">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d609e1338">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>Setter method which accepts a subclass of <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                               xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                               internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.FunctionData">
                                                   <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                              font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                              letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                              hyphenate="false">FunctionData</fo:inline>
                                                </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d609e1343">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>Setter method which accepts the values used by the
                  <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                               xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                               internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.FunctionData">
                                                   <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                              font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                              letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                              hyphenate="false">FunctionData</fo:inline>
                                                </fo:basic-link> subclass, if there are no equal
                  types.</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block> It's possible to have only one or both of them.
            Examples: <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                                provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                                id="d609e1349">
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d609e1350">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>There is <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           font-size="9pt"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em">MyFunctionData</fo:inline> bean with
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           font-size="9pt"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em">BigDecimal</fo:inline> value for a <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           font-size="9pt"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em">data</fo:inline>
                  property. Valid setters are <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           font-size="9pt"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em">setData(MyFunctionData
                  data)</fo:inline> and <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           font-size="9pt"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em">setData(BigDecimal
                  data)</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                                  space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                                  id="d609e1363">
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                          <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:block>There is <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           font-size="9pt"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em">MySecondFunctionData</fo:inline> bean with
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           font-size="9pt"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em">BigDecimal</fo:inline> prefix and <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           font-size="9pt"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em">BigDecimal</fo:inline>
                  suffix for a <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           font-size="9pt"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em">data</fo:inline> property. The prefix and
                  suffix are using equal types and we cannot have a setter
                  with the values used by <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           font-size="9pt"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em">MySecondFunctionData</fo:inline>.
                  The only one possible setter is
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           font-size="9pt"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em">setData(MySecondFunctionData data)</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                                          </fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1379">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>No methods are required for properties with <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.PropertyMetadata.ACCESS_EVENTABLE">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">ACCESS_EVENTABLE</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> access.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The accessor method names must be defined according to <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="service.dal-ref.bean.spec">
                     <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                font-family="inherit"
                                letter-spacing="inherit"
                                hyphenate="inherit">[1] <fo:inline font-style="italic">JavaBeans Spec</fo:inline>
                     </fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The properties can be optionally described with a set of metadata
      properties. The property values can be collected with <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function.getPropertyMetadata-String-">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">getPropertyMetadata(String)</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> method. The method result is <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.PropertyMetadata">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">PropertyMetadata</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>
      with: <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d609e1394">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1395">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Minimum value – available through <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.PropertyMetadata.getMinValue-String-">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">getMinValue(String)</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>. The minimum value can be different for
            the different units.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1400">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Maximum value – available through <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.PropertyMetadata.getMaxValue-String-">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">getMaxValue(String)</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>. The maximum value can be different for
            the different units.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1405">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Enumeration of values – available through <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.PropertyMetadata.getEnumValues-String-">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">getEnumValues(String)</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>. The array of the possible values is
            sorted in increasing order according to the given unit.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1410">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Step – available through <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.PropertyMetadata.getStep-String-">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">getStep(String)</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>. The difference between two values in
            series. For example, if the range is <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">[0, 100]</fo:inline>, the
            step can be <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">10</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1419">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Property access – available as a value in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.PropertyMetadata.getMetadata-String-">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">getMetadata(String)</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> result map. It's a bitmap of
            <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.Integer</fo:inline> type and doesn't depend on the
            given unit. The access is available only for the function
            properties and it's missing for the operation arguments and result
            metadata. The bitmap can be any combination of:</fo:block>
                              <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                             provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                             id="d609e1426">
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e1427">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.PropertyMetadata.ACCESS_READABLE">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">ACCESS_READABLE</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> – Marks the property as a readable.
                Function must provide a getter method for this property
                according to <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="service.dal-ref.bean.spec">
                                                <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                                           font-family="inherit"
                                                           letter-spacing="inherit"
                                                           hyphenate="inherit">[1] <fo:inline font-style="italic">JavaBeans Spec</fo:inline>
                                                </fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link>.
                Function operations must not be overridden by this getter
                method.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e1433">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.PropertyMetadata.ACCESS_WRITABLE">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">ACCESS_WRITABLE</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> – Marks the property as writable.
                Function must provide a setter method for this property
                according to <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="service.dal-ref.bean.spec">
                                                <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                                           font-family="inherit"
                                                           letter-spacing="inherit"
                                                           hyphenate="inherit">[1] <fo:inline font-style="italic">JavaBeans Spec</fo:inline>
                                                </fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link>.
                Function operations must not be overridden by this setter
                method.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e1439">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>
                                             <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                            xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                            internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.PropertyMetadata.ACCESS_EVENTABLE">
                                                <fo:inline color="blue"
                                                           font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                           letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                                           hyphenate="false">ACCESS_EVENTABLE</fo:inline>
                                             </fo:basic-link> – Marks the property as eventable.
                Function must not provide special methods because of this
                access type. <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">FunctionEvent</fo:inline> is sent on property
                change. Note that the event can be sent when there is no value
                change.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1445">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Units - available as a value in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.PropertyMetadata.getMetadata-String-">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">getMetadata(String)</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> result map. They can be requested with key
            <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.PropertyMetadata.UNITS">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">UNITS</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>. The value contains the property supported
            units. The property value type is <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.String[]</fo:inline>.
            The array first element at index <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">0</fo:inline> represents the
            default unit. Each unit must follow those rules:</fo:block>
                              <fo:list-block provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                             provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                             id="d609e1456">
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e1457">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>The International System of Units must be used where
                it's applicable. For example, kg for kilogram and km for
                kilometer.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e1459">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>If the unit name matches to a Unicode symbol name, the
                Unicode symbol must be used. For example, the degree unit
                matches to the Unicode degree sign (<fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">°</fo:inline>).</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                                 <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                               space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                               id="d609e1464">
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                                       <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>
                                          <fo:block>If the unit name doesn't match to a Unicode symbol, the
                unit symbol must be built by Unicode Basic Latin block of
                characters, superscript and subscript characters. For example,
                watt per square meter steradian is built by <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                                        font-size="9pt"
                                                        letter-spacing="0.08em">W/(m²
                sr)</fo:inline>.</fo:block>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                              <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                        space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                        space-before.maximum="5pt">If those rules cannot be applied to the unit symbol, custom
            rules are allowed.</fo:block>
                              <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                                        space-before.minimum="5pt"
                                        space-before.maximum="5pt">A set of predefined unit symbols are available in
            <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">SIUnits</fo:inline> interface.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1474">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Description – available as a value in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.PropertyMetadata.getMetadata-String-">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">getMetadata(String)</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> result map. It can be requested with key
            <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.PropertyMetadata.DESCRIPTION">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">DESCRIPTION</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link>. The property value type is
            <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                            font-size="9pt"
                                            letter-spacing="0.08em">java.lang.String</fo:inline> and specifies a user readable
            description. It doesn't depend on the given unit.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1483">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>Vendor custom properties – available as a value in <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.PropertyMetadata.getMetadata-String-">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">getMetadata(String)</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> result map and can depend on the given
            unit. Organizations that want to use custom keys that do not clash
            with OSGi Working Group defined should prefix their keys in own
            namespace.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="service.dal-function.event">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>141.4.6</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Function Property Events</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The eventable function properties can trigger a new event on each
      property value modification. It doesn't require a modification of the
      value. For example, the motion sensor can send a few events with no
      property value change when motion is detected and continued to be
      detected. The event must use <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.FunctionEvent">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">FunctionEvent</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>
      class. The event properties are: <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                                 space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                 space-after.optimum="1em"
                                 space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                                 space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                                 provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                                 provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                                 id="d609e1494">
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1495">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.FunctionEvent.FUNCTION_UID">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">FUNCTION_UID</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> – the event source function unique
            identifier.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1499">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.FunctionEvent.PROPERTY_NAME">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">PROPERTY_NAME</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> – the property name.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                     <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                   space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                   id="d609e1503">
                        <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                           <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-label>
                        <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:block>
                                 <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                                xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                                internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.FunctionEvent.PROPERTY_VALUE">
                                    <fo:inline color="blue"
                                               font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                               hyphenate="false">PROPERTY_VALUE</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:basic-link> – the property value.</fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:list-item-body>
                     </fo:list-item>
                  </fo:list-block> For example, there is function with an eventable
      boolean property called “state”. When “state” value is changed to
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">false</fo:inline>, function implementation can post: <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                            space-before.optimum="1em"
                            space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                            space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                            space-after.optimum="1em"
                            space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            wrap-option="no-wrap"
                            white-space-collapse="false"
                            white-space-treatment="preserve"
                            linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                            text-align="start"
                            font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            letter-spacing="-.0em"
                            space-before="5pt"
                            space-after="3pt"
                            space-after.conditionality="retain"
                            start-indent="inherit"
                            line-height="11pt"
                            id="d609e1510">FunctionEvent {
    dal.function.UID=acme.function
    dal.function.property.name=”state”
    dal.function.property.value=ACMEFuntionData(java.lang.Boolean.FALSE...)
}</fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="service.dal-security">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">Security</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>141.5</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>Security</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d609e1513">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>141.5.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Device Permission</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.DevicePermission">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">DevicePermission</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> controls the bundle's authority to perform
      specific privileged administrative operations on the devices. There is
      only one action for this permission <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.DevicePermission.REMOVE">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">REMOVE</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> to protect <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.remove--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">remove()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>
      method.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The name of the permission is a filter based. For more details
      about filter based permissions, see OSGi Core Specification, Filter
      Based Permissions. The filter provides an access to all device service
      properties. Filter attribute names are processed in a case sensitive
      manner. For example, the operator can give a bundle the permission to
      only manage devices of vendor "acme": <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                            space-before.optimum="1em"
                            space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                            space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                            space-after.optimum="1em"
                            space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            wrap-option="no-wrap"
                            white-space-collapse="false"
                            white-space-treatment="preserve"
                            linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                            text-align="start"
                            font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            letter-spacing="-.0em"
                            space-before="5pt"
                            space-after="3pt"
                            space-after.conditionality="retain"
                            start-indent="inherit"
                            line-height="11pt"
                            id="d609e1525">org.osgi.service.dal.DevicePermission("dal.device.hardware.vendor=acme", "remove")</fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The permission action allows the operator to assign only the
      necessary permissions to the bundle. For example, the management bundle
      can have permission to remove all registered devices: <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                            space-before.optimum="1em"
                            space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                            space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                            space-after.optimum="1em"
                            space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            wrap-option="no-wrap"
                            white-space-collapse="false"
                            white-space-treatment="preserve"
                            linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                            text-align="start"
                            font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            letter-spacing="-.0em"
                            space-before="5pt"
                            space-after="3pt"
                            space-after.conditionality="retain"
                            start-indent="inherit"
                            line-height="11pt"
                            id="d609e1528">org.osgi.service.dal.DevicePermission("*", "remove")</fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The code that needs to check the device permission must always use
      the constructor that takes the device as a parameter <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">Device</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link> with a
      single action. For example, the implementation of <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                 xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                 internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.remove--">
                     <fo:inline color="blue"
                                font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                letter-spacing="0.08em"
                                hyphenate="false">remove()</fo:inline>
                  </fo:basic-link>
      method must check that the caller has an access to the operation:
      <fo:block space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                            space-before.optimum="1em"
                            space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                            space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                            space-after.optimum="1em"
                            space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                            hyphenate="false"
                            wrap-option="no-wrap"
                            white-space-collapse="false"
                            white-space-treatment="preserve"
                            linefeed-treatment="preserve"
                            text-align="start"
                            font-family="ProductusOSGiMonoc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                            font-size="9pt"
                            letter-spacing="-.0em"
                            space-before="5pt"
                            space-after="3pt"
                            space-after.conditionality="retain"
                            start-indent="inherit"
                            line-height="11pt"
                            id="d609e1535">public class DeviceImpl implements Device {
  ...
  public void remove() {
    securityManager.checkPermission(
      new DevicePermission(this, DevicePermission.REMOVE));
  }
  ...
}</fo:block>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d609e1536">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>141.5.2</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Required Permissions</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">The <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Device</fo:inline> implementation must check the caller for
      the appropriate <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">DevicePermission</fo:inline> before execution of the
      remove operation. Once the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">DevicePermission</fo:inline> is checked
      against the caller the implementation will proceed with the actual
      operation. The operation can require a number of other permissions to
      complete. The implementation must isolate the caller from such
      permission checks by use of proper privileged blocks.</fo:block>
               <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                         space-before.minimum="5pt"
                         space-before.maximum="5pt">
                  <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">DevicePermission</fo:inline> check will keep the
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Device</fo:inline> implementation in the call stack. This requires the
      implementation to have this permission to perform the operation. The
      security policy should be aware of this and should grant the correct
      permissions. Note that the <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">DevicePermission</fo:inline> is a filter
      based permission, see OSGi Core Specification, Filter Based Permissions.
      It provides flexibility and fine control based on the
      <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                             font-size="9pt"
                             letter-spacing="0.08em">Device</fo:inline> service properties.</fo:block>
            </fo:block>
         </fo:block>
         <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dal">
            <fo:block>
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                            margin-left="0pt"
                            font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                     <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                        <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                  xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                  font-weight="normal"
                                  keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                  space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                  space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                  space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                  text-align="start"
                                  start-indent="0pt"
                                  hyphenate="false">
                           <fo:marker marker-class-name="section.head.marker">org.osgi.service.dal</fo:marker>
                           <fo:block font-size="18pt"
                                     line-height="25pt"
                                     space-before="12.5pt"
                                     space-after="12pt">
                              <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                             provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                 <fo:list-item>
                                    <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                       <fo:block>141.6</fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-label>
                                    <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                       <fo:block>org.osgi.service.dal<fo:inline id="org.osgi.service.dal-version"/>
                                       </fo:block>
                                    </fo:list-item-body>
                                 </fo:list-item>
                              </fo:list-block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"/>
               </fo:block>
            </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
Device Abstraction Layer Package Version 1.0.
 
 </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Bundles wishing to use this package must list the package in the
 Import-Package header of the bundle's manifest. This package has two types of
 users: the consumers that use the API in this package and the providers that
 implement the API in this package.
 
 </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Example import for consumers using the API in this package:
 </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
 {@code  Import-Package: org.osgi.service.dal; version="[1.0,2.0)"}
 </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
 Example import for providers implementing the API in this package:
 </fo:block>
            <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                      space-before.minimum="5pt"
                      space-before.maximum="5pt">
 {@code  Import-Package: org.osgi.service.dal; version="[1.0,1.1)"}</fo:block>
            <fo:block id="d609e1568">
               <fo:block>
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                               margin-left="0pt"
                               font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
                        <fo:block keep-with-next.within-column="always">
                           <fo:block xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                     xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                     font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                     font-weight="normal"
                                     keep-with-next.within-column="always"
                                     space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                                     space-before.optimum="1.0em"
                                     space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                                     text-align="start"
                                     start-indent="0pt"
                                     hyphenate="false">
                              <fo:block font-size="12pt"
                                        line-height="14pt"
                                        space-before="8pt"
                                        space-after="5pt">
                                 <fo:list-block provisional-distance-between-starts="1in"
                                                provisional-label-separation="0.090in">
                                    <fo:list-item>
                                       <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()" text-align="start">
                                          <fo:block>141.6.1</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-label>
                                       <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                                          <fo:block>Summary</fo:block>
                                       </fo:list-item-body>
                                    </fo:list-item>
                                 </fo:list-block>
                              </fo:block>
                           </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:list-block space-before.optimum="1em"
                              space-before.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-before.maximum="1.2em"
                              space-after.optimum="1em"
                              space-after.minimum="0.8em"
                              space-after.maximum="1.2em"
                              provisional-label-separation="0.2em"
                              provisional-distance-between-starts="12pt"
                              id="d609e1570">
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d609e1571">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Device">
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">Device</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - 
Represents the device in the OSGi service registry.
   </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d609e1579">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.DeviceException">
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">DeviceException</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - 
{@code DeviceException} is a special {@code IOException}, which is thrown to
 indicate that there is a device operation fail.
   </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d609e1587">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.DevicePermission">
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">DevicePermission</fo:inline>
                                 </fo:inline>
                              </fo:basic-link> - 
A bundle's authority to perform specific privileged administrative operations
 on the devices.
   </fo:block>
                        </fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-body>
                  </fo:list-item>
                  <fo:list-item space-before.optimum="2pt"
                                space-before.minimum="2pt"
                                space-before.maximum="2pt"
                                id="d609e1595">
                     <fo:list-item-label end-indent="label-end()">
                        <fo:block>•</fo:block>
                     </fo:list-item-label>
                     <fo:list-item-body start-indent="body-start()">
                        <fo:block>
                           <fo:block>
                              <fo:basic-link xmlns:d="http://docbook.org/ns/docbook"
                                             xmlns:xlink="http://www.w3.org/1999/xlink"
                                             internal-destination="org.osgi.service.dal.Function">
                                 <fo:inline color="inherit"
                                            font-family="inherit"
                                            letter-spacing="inherit"
                                            hyphenate="inherit">
                                    <fo:inline font-family="ProductusOSGiBookc,ArialUnicodeMS"
                                               font-size="9pt"
                                               letter-spacing="0.08em">Function</fo:inline>
