                     </fo:block>
                  </fo:block>
                  <fo:block space-before.optimum="5pt"
                            space-before.minimum="5pt"
                            space-before.maximum="5pt">
Device status indicates that the device is currently busy with an
 operation. It can be used as a value of {@link #SERVICE_STATUS} service
 property.
   </fo:block>
               </fo:block>
               <fo:block id="org.osgi.service.dal.Device.STATUS_REMOVED">
                  <fo:block>
                     <fo:block>
                        <fo:block keep-together.within-column="always"
                                  margin-left="0pt"
                                  font-family="ProductusSemibold,ArialUnicodeMS">
